# "Whenever Captain Kirk enters or attacks, choose one. If you have no cards in hand, choose one or more instead": the hand
# is read, and the modes chosen, as the trigger is put on the stack (CR 603.3c, 700.2), not again as it resolves. Kirk
# enters on turn 1 with Mox Pearl still in hand, so two modes are refused and one is chosen (an Officer). On turn 3 Bot1
# plays the Mountain it drew and casts the Pearl, attacks with an empty hand and chooses all three modes; in response it
# sacrifices Mind Stone to draw a card, so its hand is not empty as the trigger resolves. All three modes still happen, in
# printed order: it discards the drawn Mountain and draws, makes a second Officer, then both Officers and Kirk get +1/+0.

